# What `yarn test:e2e` boots the app with — committed on purpose, every value is
# throwaway. Points at the Postgres in `docker-compose.yml`; nothing here reaches
# Neon or a real secret. Spread over the shell environment by `playwright.config.ts`.
PAYLOAD_SECRET=e2e-only-payload-secret-not-for-any-deployment
DATABASE_URL=postgres://grimoria:grimoria@localhost:5433/grimoria_e2e
# Set too, or the local `.env`'s Neon value wins for migrations (`src/constants/env.ts`).
DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=postgres://grimoria:grimoria@localhost:5433/grimoria_e2e
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=e2e-only-better-auth-secret-not-for-deployment
# Not 3000, so a `next dev` on Neon is never mistaken for the e2e server; `playwright.config.ts`
# derives `baseURL` and `BETTER_AUTH_URL` from it.
PORT=3100
